1
00:00:00,500 --> 00:00:05,900
In this Incoming Goods workflow, we will
receive one complete supplier delivery.

2
00:00:06,600 --> 00:00:11,860
We will print its receiving list, check the
goods, post all outstanding quantities to

3
00:00:11,880 --> 00:00:14,160
one shelf, and verify stock.

4
00:00:16,833 --> 00:00:19,333
Step one: Match the complete delivery.

5
00:00:20,113 --> 00:00:23,373
Find the issued Purchase Order in Open Purchase Orders.

6
00:00:24,093 --> 00:00:28,233
Check the supplier, articles and
units against the delivery paperwork.

7
00:00:30,833 --> 00:00:33,433
Step two: Print the Receiving List.

8
00:00:34,353 --> 00:00:39,733
Select the Purchase Order header, open Export,
choose the Receiving List template, and

9
00:00:39,753 --> 00:00:40,733
generate the PDF.

10
00:00:43,750 --> 00:00:48,090
The list shows four ordered, none received, and four outstanding.

11
00:00:48,830 --> 00:00:51,730
Check the physical goods and tick the paper checklist.

12
00:00:52,510 --> 00:00:54,650
Printing alone does not update stock.

13
00:00:57,333 --> 00:01:00,113
Step three: Receive the whole order.

14
00:01:00,813 --> 00:01:05,933
Once every outstanding piece has arrived and
passed your checks, select the Purchase Order

15
00:01:05,953 --> 00:01:08,053
header and choose Receive Order.

16
00:01:10,667 --> 00:01:14,987
Choose the receiving shelf and review all outstanding quantities.

17
00:01:15,727 --> 00:01:18,767
This simple dialog has no quantity-entry fields.

18
00:01:19,467 --> 00:01:24,067
Confirm Receive Order only for a
complete delivery into this location.

19
00:01:26,792 --> 00:01:29,452
Review the actual result before closing.

20
00:01:29,972 --> 00:01:35,512
Four pieces were received, the requirement
moved to Delivered, and the Purchase Order is

21
00:01:35,532 --> 00:01:40,392
fully received. If there are warnings,
inspect them before retrying.

22
00:01:43,000 --> 00:01:46,920
Step four: Verify stock and outstanding quantities.

23
00:01:47,660 --> 00:01:48,840
Open the article Stock tab.

24
00:01:49,320 --> 00:01:54,040
The shelf now holds four pieces and
has no remaining quantity on order.

25
00:01:56,667 --> 00:02:01,407
The regenerated Receiving List confirms
four received and zero outstanding.

26
00:02:02,127 --> 00:02:03,807
Incoming Goods is complete.

27
00:02:04,607 --> 00:02:08,247
Hand the accepted goods to Dispatch for picking and packing.

28
00:02:10,917 --> 00:02:13,537
Pause for details and follow the full guide.
